              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 13.14–15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 4.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.8.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 8.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.12.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 12.40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.28.26+ACT.28.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 28.26–27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So he told me to go and give the people this message: “No matter how much you listen, you will not understand. No matter how much you look, you will not know what is happening.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he said to me, “Make the minds of these people dull, their ears deaf, and their eyes blind, so that they cannot see or hear or understand. If they did, they might turn to me and be healed.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I asked, “How long will it be like this, Lord?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He answered, “Until the cities are ruined and empty — until the houses are uninhabited — until the land itself is a desolate waste. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will send the people far away and make the whole land desolate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even if one person out of ten remains in the land, he too will be destroyed; he will be like the stump of an oak tree that has been cut down.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(The stump represents a new beginning for God's people.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
